# Brother b-PAC SDK vendor file
# Proprietary, redistributable only under Brother's licence, and it arrives with the
# b-PAC SDK installer rather than from npm. Copy it in from the installer's vendor
# folder; every checkout and every CI build needs it dropped in before the silent
# print button can work. See src/modules/assets/services/bpacService.ts.
/public/vendor/bpac.js
